    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<nav class="woocommerce-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="">Home</a>&nbsp;&#47;&nbsp;Our Products</nav><header class="woocommerce-products-header"><h1 class="woocommerce-products-header__title page-title">Our Products</h1><div class="page-description"><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Potato Flakes （Mashed Potato Powder)</h2></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our <strong>Potato Flakes</strong> are a high-quality, dehydrated potato ingredient essential for the production of premium snack foods, specialty potato crisps, extruded products, and a versatile component in foodservice applications and prepared food ingredients.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We produce our flakes through advanced dehydration and deep-processing techniques, ensuring they retain the natural flavor, structure, and functionality required by top food manufacturers.</p><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Key Product Advantages:</h3><h4 class="wp-block-heading">1. Optimal Raw Material Composition</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We select specific potato varieties renowned for their quality and high solid content, including <strong>Atlantic, Shepody, and Burbank</strong>. This dedication to raw material excellence ensures superior performance:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>High Dry Matter:</strong> Raw materials boast a dry matter content of <strong>over 20%</strong>, resulting in higher yield and better texture for your finished products.</li></ul><h4 class="wp-block-heading">2. Excellent Color Stability (Low Reducing Sugars)</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Controlling reducing sugars is critical for snack production. Our proprietary processing minimizes these compounds to prevent undesirable browning:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Low Reducing Sugars:</strong> By maintaining low reducing sugar levels, our flakes mitigate the <strong>Maillard reaction</strong> during frying or baking, ensuring your final products achieve a consistent, attractive, and light color.</li></ul><h4 class="wp-block-heading">3. Superior Visual Quality (Minimal Black Specks)</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Appearance is paramount in the snack industry. Our commitment to high-grade raw potatoes and advanced manufacturing technology results in a visually clean product:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Minimal Black Specks:</strong> Thanks to our meticulous sourcing and cutting-edge processing, the flake mixture has an extremely low black specks count, guaranteeing <strong>excellent cosmetic appearance</strong> and consistent quality across every batch.</li></ul></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full"><img src="/images/Dinweys-Potato-flakes-1-scaled.jpg" alt="potato flakes" class="wp-image-1272"  width="2560" height="2560" /></figure></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%"><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity" /><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Premium Frozen French Fries</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">As one of the leading French Fry exporters in China, we are strategically located in the country&#8217;s <strong>core potato growing and deep-processing industrial cluster</strong>. This positioning grants us unparalleled competitive advantages.</p><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Core Competitive Advantages:</h3><h4 class="wp-block-heading">1. Superior Raw Material Sourcing</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The quality of our fries begins with the excellence of our potatoes:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Locally Sourced Premium Material:</strong> All raw materials are sourced exclusively from the local and surrounding regions, including <strong>Northern Hebei and Inner Mongolia</strong>. This ensures a consistent supply of high-solids potatoes grown under ideal climatic and soil conditions.</li><li><strong>Variety Excellence:</strong> We utilize the <strong>Russet Burbank</strong> variety exclusively for our processing. Russet Burbank is globally recognized for its ideal shape, texture, and high solid content, making it the preferred choice for producing premium, long, and crispy French fries.</li></ul><h4 class="wp-block-heading">2. Advanced Production Technology &amp; Capacity</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our industrial cluster is committed to continuous technological upgrades and capacity optimization:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Cutting-Edge Technology:</strong> We continuously upgrade our equipment and adopt the <strong>most advanced production techniques in the industry</strong>. This ensures maximum stability and consistency throughout the cutting, blanching, frying, and freezing processes.</li><li><strong>Significant Capacity Advantage:</strong> Leveraging the scale of our integrated industrial cluster, we possess a <strong>highly competitive production capacity</strong>, enabling us to meet the demands of large-scale, high-frequency international orders.</li></ul><h4 class="wp-block-heading">3. Efficient and Stable Cold Chain Logistics</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We are dedicated to delivering peak freshness to our global customers:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> Our processing base is situated just <strong>300 kilometers</strong> from the nearest major seaport.</li><li><strong>Rapid, Stable Transit:</strong> Utilizing the high-speed highway network, goods arrive quickly at the port. Furthermore, transport operates under <strong>stable, controlled end-to-end cold chain management</strong>, ensuring the fries maintain perfect quality and freshness throughout the entire supply chain.</li></ul></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/Dinweys-french-fries-1.jpg" alt="Dinweys Frozen French Fries" class="wp-image-1333"  width="632" height="632" /></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Here is the optimized English product introduction for your Potato Starch, focusing on high volume, quality, and flexible service:</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity" /><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Top-Grade Potato Starch</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">As a key product derived from our location in the heart of the potato production area, our <strong>Potato Starch</strong> benefits from massive production capacity and is widely used across various sectors of the food processing industry.</p><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Product Highlights and Advantages:</h3><h4 class="wp-block-heading">1. Smart Raw Material Sourcing</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our sourcing strategy ensures efficiency without compromising quality:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Quality Input:</strong> We primarily utilize potatoes that are slightly below the dimensional specifications required for our Potato Flakes production. This approach optimizes resource use while still maintaining the <strong>high overall quality</strong> necessary for premium starch.</li></ul><h4 class="wp-block-heading">2. Advanced Production Technology &amp; High Capacity</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We combine scale with precision to deliver consistent quality:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>State-of-the-Art Processing:</strong> We employ the <strong>latest advanced production equipment and technologies</strong> in starch extraction and refining. This investment guarantees that our potato starch consistently meets strict quality, purity, and functional standards.</li><li><strong>Significant Capacity:</strong> Our large-scale operations result in <strong>substantial production capacity</strong>, positioning us as a reliable supplier capable of meeting high-volume and sustained demands globally.</li></ul><h4 class="wp-block-heading">3. Custom Packaging and OEM Services</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We offer flexible solutions to integrate with your supply chain:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>OEM Customization:</strong> We actively welcome and support <strong>OEM customization</strong> requests.</li><li><strong>Streamlined Supply Chain:</strong> Backed by our mature and complete supply chain infrastructure, we provide customers with <strong>convenient, fast, and comprehensive service</strong> from order placement to delivery.</li></ul></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/Potato-Starch.png" alt="Potato starch" class="wp-image-1276"  width="547" height="452" /></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Here is the English version summarizing your other advantageous products:</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity" /><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Other Advantageous Products &amp; Local Specialties</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">In addition to our core deep-processed potato products, our strategic location in Northern China allows us to source and process a rich variety of high-quality local specialties:</p><h3 class="wp-block-heading">1. Cereals, Grains, and Pulses</h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our selection of staple grains and beans provides nutritious and versatile options for the food industry:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Grains:</strong> Millet, Yellow Millet (Proso Millet), Buckwheat, Oat Groats/Naked Oats (You Mai),</li><li><strong>Beans/Pulses:</strong> Red Beans, Mung Beans, Kidney Beans, Black Beans, and other varieties.</li></ul><h3 class="wp-block-heading">2. Specialty Crops</h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We also offer unique ingredients derived from other local agricultural advantages:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>High-Quality Sweet and Waxy Corn:</strong> Excellent for fresh, frozen, or processed applications.</li><li><strong>Milk Thistle Seeds (Silybum Marianum):</strong> Highly valued for its functional and health applications.</li><li><strong>Deep-Processed Flaxseed Products:</strong> Including various forms of flaxseed for food and industrial use.</li><li><strong>Quinoa products:</strong> inculuding Quinoa flour, flakes, and snacks</li></ul><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Why Choose Our Specialty Products?</h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph">All these products are sourced directly from <strong>local agricultural specialties</strong> and are supported by a <strong>mature and comprehensive deep-processing system</strong>. This integration ensures high quality, reliable supply, and allows us to offer customers a <strong>wide range of choices</strong> with <strong>strong price competitiveness</strong>.</p></div></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></div></header><div class="woocommerce-notices-wrapper"></div><p class=